        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_09",
          "title": "10 Media and Publicity 102-105",
          "page": 1,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_10",
          "title": "Members of Parliament Local Area Development Scheme( MPLADS)",
          "page": 1,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_11",
          "title": "1.4 The Statistics Wing, called National Statistics Office (NSO), coordinates the statistical activities in",
          "page": 2,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_12",
          "title": "the country and is responsible for evolving and laying, down statistical standards. India is subscriber to the",
          "page": 2,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_13",
          "title": "International Monetary Fund’s (IMF) Special Data Dissemination Standards (SDDS) and is currently",
          "page": 2,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_14",
          "title": "fulfilling the Standards. The Ministry maintains an ‘Advance Release Calendar’ for its data categories",
          "page": 2,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_15",
          "title": "covered under the SDDS, which is disseminated on the Ministry’s website as well as on the Dissemination",
          "page": 2,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_16",
          "title": "Standards Bulletin Board (DSBB) of the IMF. The Ministry releases the datasets covered under the Real",
          "page": 2,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_17",
          "title": "Sector of SDDS through press notes and its website simultaneously. India has strong system of official",
          "page": 2,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_18",
          "title": "statistics and is among the leading countries in the area of official statistics. The Ministry’s officials have been",
          "page": 2,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_19",
          "title": "associated with international agencies on the development of methodologies, particularly in the areas of",
          "page": 2,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_20",
          "title": "statistics and classifications, statistical compilations and international practices. The contribution of the",
          "page": 3,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_21",
          "title": "Ministry’s officials in international meetings on these subjects has been highly appreciated.",
          "page": 3,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_22",
          "title": "1.8 International Comparison Programme (ICP) is the largest statistical initiative in the world under the",
          "page": 3,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_23",
          "title": "aegis of United Nations Statistics Division (UNSD). The World Bank is implementing this programme at",
          "page": 3,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_24",
          "title": "global level and Asian Development Bank (ADB) is the nodal implementing agency at Asia and the Pacific",
          "page": 3,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_25",
          "title": "Region. The main objectives of ICP are to produce Purchasing Power Parities (PPPs) and Price Level Indices",
          "page": 3,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_26",
          "title": "and to convert volume and per capita measures of GDP into common currencies using PPPs. The World Bank",
          "page": 3,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_27",
          "title": "released the report of ICP 2021 cycle in August, 2025, which included data for India. According to these",
          "page": 3,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_28",
          "title": "results, India ranks as the third-largest economy globally.",
          "page": 3,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_29",
          "title": "1.5 The NSO, MoSPI is responsible for preparation of national accounts, which include the estimates of",
          "page": 3,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_30",
          "title": "In its endeavour to enhance the user experience and responsiveness, various new sections like",
          "page": 4,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_31",
          "title": "1.10 The Index of Industrial Production (IIP) with base year 2011-12 is compiled and published by the",
          "page": 4,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_32",
          "title": "Economic Statistics Division (ESD) of MoSPI. The release timeline of IIP has been improved by reducing it",
          "page": 4,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_33",
          "title": "from six weeks to four weeks, ensuring timelier availability of industrial output data. It is published on the",
          "page": 4,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_34",
          "title": "28th of every month (or the next working day if 28th is holiday) with time lag of four weeks from the",
          "page": 4,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_35",
          "title": "reference month. The IIP covers three sectors namely Mining, Manufacturing and Electricity. The IIP for",
          "page": 4,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_36",
          "title": "2024-25 stands at 152.6, registering growth of 4%. The base year revision exercise of IIP is in progress and",
          "page": 4,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_37",
          "title": "Technical Advisory Committee (TAC) for the base year revision of IIP has been constituted on 27th",
          "page": 4,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_38",
          "title": "September 2024 for the same.",
          "page": 4,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_39",
          "title": "1.11 The Ministry is entrusted with the development of indicator framework for Sustainable Development",
          "page": 4,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_40",
          "title": "Till 31st December, 2025, 38 meetings of ACNAS and its Sub -committees have been held. New series’",
          "page": 5,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_41",
          "title": "release by MoSPI will be done on 27th February, 2026.",
          "page": 5,
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec_02_42",
